ds that let you talk about sun, wind, and snow like a local."],["privet_russian","2026-08-31","ep068","Ep 68: Today we’re ringing the school bell and unlocking the everyday Russian words that let you talk about classes, teachers, and learning adventures!"],["privet_russian","2026-08-24","ep067","Ep 67: Today we meet some wonderful Russian animal words that will help you talk about the creatures all around us, from tiny birds to big bears."],["privet_russian","2026-08-17","ep066","Ep 66: Today we open the door to the warm, everyday words Russians use to talk about the people closest to them."],["privet_russian","2026-08-10","ep065","Ep 65: Let's dress up our Russian skills today with everyday clothing words that help you talk about what you're wearing right now!"],["privet_russian","2026-08-03","ep064","Ep 64: Step inside a cozy Russian home and unlock the everyday words that let you talk about rooms, furniture, and family life!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-27","ep063","Ep 63: Today we’re strapping on our рюкзак and jetting off to master Russian travel words that turn every trip into an adventure!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-20","ep062","Ep 62: Today we step into Russia's stunning natural world to learn words that let you talk about trees, rivers, forests, and more!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-18","ep061","Ep 61: Today we’re heading to the Russian магазин to unlock shopping words that turn every trip into a language adventure!"],["privet_russian","2026-07-16","ep060","Ep 60: Today we’re tasting our way through tasty Russian food words that will have you saying “вкусно!” like a true local."],["privet_russian","2026-07-14","ep059","Ep 59: Today we step outside into the wild Russian weather to learn words that let you describe sun, rain, wind, and snow like a local."],["privet_russian","2026-07-13","ep058","Ep 58: Today we’re roaring, barking, and chirping our way through the animal kingdom to unlock the Russian words that let you talk about every creature from pets t